rooms_desc ({"You enter the dimensional portal to Inigo Montoya's house and findyourself falling through a whirling cloud of many patterns and colours.You can't help thinking who slipped you that acid tab........Floating around you are several psychedelic portals showing distorted viewsof the Church, the Adventurer's Guild and the Village Shop.To the north you can see some sort of hallway........","You are in the eastern end of a hallway. There is a distinct oriental style tothe decor with paper screens against the walls and persian rugs scatteredabout the floor. There is an oil lamp hanging low from the ceiling castinga dim glow about the place.A strong smell of oriental cooking eminates from the north, and you canhear music coming from the east, while to the south you can see the swirlingpsychedelia of the portals.The hallway continues west....","You are in some sort of lounge. There are more painted screens here, two ofwhich slide to one side to form doorways to the north and west. The flooris completely covered by large, silk cushions of various colours. Theylook very comfortable to sit on. Against the southern and eastern walls restsa low, L-shaped bamboo table, on which sits a television, video recorderan impressive looking stereo and a SUN workstation.","You are in the western end of a hallway. There is a distinctive orientalstyle to the decor with paper screens against the walls and persian rugsscattered about the floor. There is an oil lamp hanging from the ceiling.There is a door in each of the north and west walls, and a tableup against the south wall. On the table is a small ash-catcher with astick of burning incense held in it. There is a sweet smell in the air.The hallway continues east....","You are in a spacious kitchen. The heat in here is intense. In the centreof the room is a large food preparation area aswell as several gas fireburners. Around the walls are many well-stocked cupboards, a stove andwhat looks very much like a kiln. On a unit in one corner sits a stereowhich is blasting out some heavy rock music. Next to the stereo lies anempty CD case.There are some servants bustling about preparing a sumptuous chinese meal.As you wander around, the smell of various different dishes tingles inyour nostrils.There are sliding screen doors leading to the south and east, aswell asa serving hatch in the east wall, through which you can see the diningroom, while to the north there is a heavy iron door, slightly ajar,beyond which you can make out a stone stairway leading down.","You have entered what is quite clearly the dining room. In the centre ofthe room is a large table which stands about a foot off the ground. Onthe table there are places set for several people with china bowls andchopsticks, perhaps there is going to be a banquet here later. Aroundthe table are many cushions to sit on, while on the walls hang variousoil paintings.In the west wall there is a sliding screen door, aswell as a servinghatch, through which you can see the kitchen.There are two large speakers set into the south wall, one in each ofthe top corners. Between the speakers, in the centre of the wall, isanother screen door.","You are in a large bedroom. Your attention is immediately drawn towards thelarge water bed against the northern wall. The carpet feels very luxuriousunder your feet. In the southeastern corner, through a gap in somepartitioning screens, you can see a large circular jacuzzi. There are morescreens around the walls and two slide over the very secure looking doors tothe south and west.","You walk through the iron door and follow the stairs down into a dimlylit cellar. The only light is from a strange, eerie glow from the walls.Scattered around are various bottle racks, wooden crates and barrels.The only exit is back up the stairs.","A strange feeling of calm overcomes you as you walk into some kind ofshrine. The sound of sitar music fills the air. Around the walls hangmany different weapons. There is an alcove in the west wall in whichstands a ten foot tall golden statue in front of which lies a prayer mat.On either side of the statue stand two oil burners, however they must befilled with some special kind of oil, for they not only provide dimlighting, but fill the room with a sweet smelling, intoxicating smoke.The only way out appears to be the way you came in.","You are in a large, domed room. Even the eastern door is formed so that theroom is a perfect hemisphere. In the centre of the room is a round bed withseveral cushions lying on it. Around the bed are several low tables coveredwith various bits of junk and clutter.As you close the door behind you, the phosphorescent glow eminating from thewalls fades to blackness and an impressive laser hologram display commences...",})
rooms_short ({"You find yourself in a whirling, psychedelic cloud between dimensions........","You are in the eastern end of a hallway.","You are in a comfortable looking lounge","You are in the western end of a hallway.","You are in a spacious kitchen","You have entered what is quite clearly the dining room","You are in a large bedroom.","You follow some stairs down into the cellar","You walk into some kind of shrine","You are in a large, domed room",})
